<title>UK: Phytopharm shares fall on product setback.</title>
<headline>Phytopharm shares fall on product setback.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Phytopharm Plc fell sharply on Thursday after the firm said it would delay the launch of its new eczema product Zemaphyte.</p>
<p>Phytopharm shares were down 26p or 12.5 percent to 182-1/2p by 0953 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
